10554 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Michael Goldhaber\054 building on Simon\031s insight\054 articulated the economic logic of the internet age\072 capital does not create attention\056 Capital follows where attention has already accumulated\056 Paying for attention is not enough \024 you have to earn it with compelling stories and engaging content\056\n\nThis principle now governs virtually every economic actor\056 From elementary\055school students posting on TikTok to global CEOs cultivating distinctive public personas \024 consistently wearing a signature leather jacket to every public appearance\054 for instance \024 attention capture has become a prerequisite for economic relevance\056)
