10597 0 obj
  << /ActualText (At the other end of the spectrum lies the long tail\054 where a different logic operates\056 In the industrial economy\054 long\055tail participants were considered failures \024 unable to achieve economies of scale\056 In the attention economy\054 the long tail is something else\072 a network of niche communities held together by shared tastes and genuine cohesion\056 Rather than chasing millions of shallow\054 volatile clicks\054 these communities cultivate small numbers of deeply committed members who willingly invest both time and money\056\n\nThe Discord\055 and Reddit\055based subcultures built around specific software tools or independent games are the clearest examples\056 A developer with a few thousand genuinely passionate users can generate high revenue per user and exceptional loyalty \024 without ever trending anywhere\056 In crypto investor communities\054 this logic is reinforced by the widespread \034mid\055curve\035 meme\054 which mocks the average\054 middle\055of\055the\055distribution position as the worst place to be\056 The narrative encourages investors to trust only the most battle\055tested projects or the most extreme risk plays\054 rejecting anything in between\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 10598 0 R
     /Pg 3211 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

