10632 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Faced with asset oversupply and attention bottlenecks\054 the practical response for any firm is to make its organization and its outputs look more like media\056 What is surprising is where this transformation is most visible\072 not in crypto startups\054 but in some of the most conservative financial institutions in the world\056\n\nJ\056P\056 Morgan\031s annual investment outlook\054 Eye on the Market\054 is a telling example\056 Where it once used functional titles like \034Outlook 2021\035 with dry subtitles like \034Hazmat Recovery\054\035 it now leads with literary titles \024 \034The Alchemist\054\035 \034Smothering Heights\035 \024 and visually bold cover art\056 The underlying acknowledgment is clear\072 shrinking attention spans are a market condition that must be managed\054 and media logic has to be adopted even in institutional finance\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 10633 0 R
     /Pg 3848 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

