10655 0 obj
  << /ActualText ( \024 the infrastructure of a decentralized\054 user\055owned internet\056 This was not spin\056 It was genuine narrative engineering\072 connecting distributed ledger technology to the era\031s most resonant concerns \024 platform monopoly\054 data sovereignty\054 digital democracy \024 in a way that gave regulators a new frame and gave institutional investors a justification for entry\056\n\nThe broader industry followed\056 Sequoia launched Crucible Moments\054 a podcast series archiving founder narratives\056 Greylock built Greymatter\054 a content platform to distribute partners\031 perspectives\056 Index Ventures accumulated publications\056 The top tier of venture capital stopped being anonymous facilitators of capital and became media actors \024 generating and distributing their own interpretive frameworks for what technology means and who builds the future\056)
