10684 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The U\056S\056 platform RealT is an early version of this\056 RealT sells tokenized property shares and distributes weekly rental income\054 but its deeper effect is on investor behavior\056 Through referral programs\054 community calls\054 and Discord groups\054 it converts buy\055and\055hold investors into active participants who talk about their holdings\054 recruit others\054 and keep assets circulating in conversation\056 The property never sits quietly in a portfolio\056 It becomes content \024 an investment that is also a media unit\054 continuously recirculating within a community\056\n\nThe real significance of tokenization is not fractionalization\056 It is the transformation of ownership from a private act into a social one\056)
