10695 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Tokenization is no longer confined to real estate or art\056 Human creativity and future earnings are now being decomposed into tradable financial products\056\n\nThe precedent is not new\056 In 1997\054 David Bowie securitized his future music royalties\054 issuing \034Bowie Bonds\035 backed by his catalog \024 an early demonstration that personal creative output could be treated as a financial asset\056 What distributed ledger technology has done is democratize that capability\054 extending it far beyond major labels and pop stars\056\n\nRoyaltiz\054 a platform launched in France\054 is the clearest current example\056 It allows athletes and influencers to tokenize a share of their projected future earnings \024 from prize money\054 sponsorships\054 and brand deals \024 enabling fans to invest directly in a person\031s career\056 Participants include national soccer players\054 MMA fighters\054 and Formula 1 drivers\056 Royaltiz has now contracted with over 200 creators and athletes\054 with cumulative transaction volume exceeding \044200 million\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 10696 0 R
     /Pg 5067 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

