10760 0 obj
  << /ActualText (narrative\072 low stock price\054 high short interest\054 massive dilution\054 and social media amplification \024 the ingredients for a short squeeze\056 They were not buying the business\056 They were buying the script\056\n\nAggregate account\055level research confirms that this kind of concentration weakens diversification and increases downside exposure\056 Systematically outperforming the market also proves elusive\056 The \034Koreafication\035 of U\056S\056 markets does not mean any single country\031s investors are irrational\056 It demonstrates that any market \024 given mobile access\054 low transaction costs\054 and narrative\055driven asset preferences \024 can be mediatized\056 And in mediatized markets\054 valuation is no longer determined solely by earnings projections\056 It is also determined by who is talking about the asset and which community has adopted it as a shared focal point\056)
