10768 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Narrative\055driven retail trading is not just moving individual stock prices\056 It is reshaping the structural plumbing of markets\056\n\nAccording to Korea Capital Market Institute data\054 75\02380\045 of U\056S\056 overnight equity trading in the first half of 2024 originated in Asia\054 with Korea accounting for more than 75\045 of that Asian volume at peak activity\056 In response\054 NYSE Arca filed for rule changes to enable 22\055hour weekday trading\056 The SEC approved the changes in February 2025\056 Global capital market infrastructure adjusted to the behavioral rhythms of a new kind of marginal investor\056\n\nThe endpoint of asset mediatization is meme\055ification \024 and the silver market in early 2026 showed it can happen to anything\056 Silver rose approximately 150\045 in 2025\054 then surged to \044121\05660 per ounce in January 2026 before collapsing more than 25\045 the following day\056 The move was not primarily supply\055demand driven\056 It combined tight physical market conditions with social media propagation\054 deliberate misinformation\054 and a wave of retail ETF buying \024 the same mechanics that drove GameStop in 2021\054 applied to a centuries\055old commodity\056\n\nThe enabling infrastructure is community platforms\072 Telegram groups and Discord servers where small clusters of users deconstruct information in real time\054 attach visual memes to specific assets\054 and coordinate buying that functions as a Schelling point)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 10771 0 R
