10785 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The obvious counterargument runs something like this\072 as AI agents become capable of near\055infinite information search and comparison\054 information asymmetry collapses\056 Search costs approach zero\056 Asset prices converge toward structured data and fundamental cash flows\056 Tokenization\054 by making assets more granular\054 standardized\054 and machine\055readable\054 accelerates this process \024 driving toward the mechanization of assets\054 not their mediatization\056\n\nThis argument is half right\054 and half wrong in an important way\056\n\nAI does reduce primitive information scarcity\056 It will erode premiums built on nothing more than information gaps\056 But it does not eliminate the scarcity of trust\054 interpretation\054 and collective coordination\056 Herbert Simon\031s core insight \024 that attention is the binding constraint in an information\055rich world \024 does not disappear in an AI\055mediated environment\056 It sharpens\056\n\nAs information search costs fall toward zero\054 what becomes genuinely scarce is\072 the limited number of attention slots humans can act upon\073 the exposure slots prioritized by platform algorithms and AI recommendation interfaces\073 and the interpretive frameworks that align dispersed market participants in a shared direction\056\n\nPut differently\072 what weakens in the AI era is crude narrative built on ignorance\056 What strengthens is sophisticated narrative built on trust\054 expectation\054 and collective focus\056 Future competitive assets will need to be machine\055readable and humanly compelling \024 structured enough to be recommended algorithmically\054 persuasive enough to be chosen by people\056\n\nAI does not eliminate narrative competition\056 It raises the bar\056 Competition over which assets get discovered\054 recommended\054 and trusted will become more intense\054 not less\056 Narrative is therefore not an embellishment on top of fundamentals\056 It is an internal variable that mediates liquidity\054 cost of capital\054 customer acquisition\054 and regulatory receptivity\056 The mediatization of assets is not a pre\055AI transitional phase\056 It is a structural condition that AI will deepen\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 10786 0 R
     /Pg 6390 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

